# GIS Detection Backend

Backend services for the GIS Detection project with Google Earth Engine integration.

## Features

- FastAPI web framework
- Google Earth Engine API integration
- Geospatial data processing
- Cloud storage integration

## Setup

```bash
uv sync
```

## Development

```bash
uv run uvicorn gateway_main:app --reload
```
